        "edge_media_to_caption": {
            "edges": [
                {
                    "node": {
                        "text": "We are vessels of cosmic consciousness.\n\nIn every gesture, we hold universes. In every step, we walk on sacred ground. In every connection, we weave the web of existence.\n\nThese three moments capture the same truth: There is no separation between the mundane and the mystical. The same geometric patterns that spiral through galaxies pulse through our veins. The same force that moves the stars moves through our fingertips as we create, through our feet as we journey, through our minds as we connect.\n\nWe are not IN the universe - we ARE the universe experiencing itself. Every breath is a prayer, every movement a dance with infinity, every interaction a recognition of the One appearing as many.\n\nThe sacred geometry isn't just around us - it IS us. \u2728\ud83c\udf00"
                    }
                }
            ]
        },
